    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "wow okay thats kinda scary lol. but like i really dont want to deal with an er bill if i can help it. if i skip the hospital for tonight, what's a safe way to handle this at home? like is there a certain amount of ibuprofen or something else i can take to just make the pain go away and help with the breathing so i can just rest?",
